00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:32,920
have very low-hanging fruit, very easy ways of making money.

251
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:34,640
But we're not there yet.

252
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,920
We don't see this even close.

253
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:38,760
We don't have any concrete world of this.

254
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:40,360
All right, questions?

255
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,320
Everyone happy?

256
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:43,120
Everyone indexing already?

257
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,480
All right.

